## Mixture of Experts

```python
from draco.models.moe.expert import Expert, ExpertGroup
from draco.models.moe.router import TopKRouter
from draco.models.moe.dispatch import TokenDispatcher

# Router: decides which tokens go to which experts
router = TopKRouter(hidden_dim=64, num_experts=8, top_k=2)

# Expert group: the actual FFN experts
experts = ExpertGroup(num_experts=8, hidden_dim=64, intermediate_dim=128)

# Dispatch: route tokens to experts
x = torch.randn(32, 64)
indices, weights, aux = router.forward(x)
output = experts.forward(x, indices, weights)

print(f"Load balancing loss: {aux['load_balancing_loss'].item():.4f}")

# Token dispatcher for capacity-limited routing
dispatcher = TokenDispatcher(num_experts=8, expert_capacity=16)
```

