## Configuration

```python
from draco.config import DracoConfig, get_config, set_config

# Read defaults
config = get_config()
print(config.default_dtype)                    # "auto"
print(config.default_max_model_len)            # 8192
print(config.default_gpu_memory_utilization)   # 0.90
print(config.max_num_seqs)                     # 256
print(config.enable_paged_attention)           # True
print(config.kv_cache_block_size)              # 16
print(config.enable_metrics)                   # True

# Override
set_config(DracoConfig(
    default_dtype="bfloat16",
    max_num_seqs=512,
    enable_paged_attention=False,
    verbose=True,
))
```

